  description "Owner2026-10-12 explicitly authorizes 対戦、試行、切り替えまで承認 after concrete application v0.25.0-rc.5 additional fixed1battle/max38advances/200physical attempts request. Cumulative prior61, new maximum261; unpriced. Accepted ADR0072/0074/0075 govern reserved turn pipeline v1, policy v4/output v2/prompt v4 and preserved historical bindings. PR190 merged at f89192418dbeba67bcf7773d561ccee751e0c633, exact-main CI38186872912 all passed, annotated tag v0.25.0-rc.5 verified. Execute one Stage fixture; successful exact artifacts then production promotion and independent readback. Retain all four failed fixtures and unknown physical sends; no automatic rerun or character-generation trial. Prior production application v0.24.0-rc.9. Stage38189337992 failed after36attempts/8committed turns because turn9 charged4MP from1; cumulative97. No Promote dispatched. Proposed ADR0076 revision1 per-action canonical rejection/feedback needs owner acceptance before implementation. Proposed repair candidate application v0.25.0-rc.6 and additional fixed1battle/max164attempts preserve cumulative261maximum. Completion requires terminal battle, closed usage, memory continuity, successful Stage and exact-artifact production health/auth/traffic readback."
